      },
      {
        "name": "LRO Pattern (SyncPoller/PollerFlux)",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Blob storage operations don't involve long-running operations (LROs) in the Azure SDK sense. No SyncPoller/PollerFlux is needed for blob upload/download/delete/list. N/A effectively — no violation."
      },
      {
        "name": "Async Uses Project Reactor (Mono/Flux)",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Async service uses Mono and Flux from Project Reactor. No CompletableFuture or RxJava. No .block() inside async service implementations (only in Main demo, which is acceptable)."
      },
      {
        "name": "Service-Specific Exception Handling",
        "passed": false,
        "reason": "No BlobStorageException handling anywhere in the codebase. The sync service methods declare throws Exception. No status code inspection. Main.java only catches generic Exception."
      },
      {
        "name": "Code Compiles (mvn compile / gradle compileJava)",
        "passed": false,
        "reason": "Cannot compile. Multiple fatal errors: private Duration inner classes accessed from Main, Duration type shadows java.time.Duration causing type mismatches with Builder, ExponentialBackoffOptions not accepted by retryOptions(), missing azure-core-http-netty dependency for NettyAsyncHttpClientBuilder."
